UPDATE "City" SET "published" = 1, "intro" = 'Opelika''s listing centers on Bamboo Belles, which plays American Mahjong only, using the current official National Mah Jongg League card. Open play moves between local spots, including a bakery, a brewery and a steakhouse with a wine list, so check each session''s venue and price before you go.' WHERE "slug" = 'opelika';
UPDATE "City" SET "published" = 1, "intro" = 'Rye and the surrounding Westchester towns are covered by Mahj Atelier, which runs open play and Mahj 101 beginner lessons at Atelier Modern in Larchmont and at Harrison Meadows in Harrison. Open play follows the official NMJL card, and guests are asked to bring their own current card. Morning and evening sessions are listed on the club''s site.' WHERE "slug" = 'rye';
UPDATE "City" SET "published" = 1, "intro" = 'New Bedford''s American Mahjong happens at Coastal Bubbles & Wine Bar, home of Coastal Bubbles Mahjong Society. Mahjong Monday brings open play and Mahjong 101 and 102 lessons, and there are seasonal parties. Open play is for people who already know the basics, and guests bring an official 2026 NMJL card.' WHERE "slug" = 'new-bedford';
UPDATE "City" SET "published" = 1, "intro" = 'Roswell''s listing comes from The Tiled Sparrow, which hosts open play, guided play and Mahjong 101 lessons at breweries and restaurants in Roswell and nearby Milton. Rules follow the NMJL card, and the venue changes from week to week, so check the address on each event before you go.' WHERE "slug" = 'roswell';
UPDATE "City" SET "published" = 1, "intro" = 'Panama City has Tile Tuesday, an open-play night run by Bay County Mahj at The Portal Downtown on Harrison Avenue. Players bring their National Mah Jongg League card, sets are provided, and drinks and snacks are sold on site.' WHERE "slug" = 'panama-city';
UPDATE "City" SET "published" = 1, "intro" = 'Newburyport''s listing is Port Social, which runs open play meet-ups and guided play at The Hive on State Street. Open play is for American Mahjong players who are already comfortable with the game, so newer players may prefer the guided sessions. Bring an official 2026 National Mah Jongg League card.' WHERE "slug" = 'newburyport';
UPDATE "City" SET "published" = 1, "intro" = 'Portsmouth and the New Hampshire Seacoast are covered by Bird Bam Mahjong, which offers American Mahjong social play and intro lessons. Most sessions are at Bird Bam Studio on Islington Street, with others at cafes and venues such as Auspicious Brew in Dover. Players bring a 2026 NMJL card, and some sessions assume you know the basics.' WHERE "slug" = 'portsmouth';
UPDATE "City" SET "published" = 1, "intro" = 'Youngsville, in the Lafayette area, is home to Tile Society of Acadiana, a studio on Fortune Road with American Mahjong open play, a strategy class and an etiquette class, plus seasonal tournaments. Reserve your seat on the club''s site, as sessions have limited space.' WHERE "slug" = 'youngsville';
UPDATE "City" SET "published" = 1, "intro" = 'Whitehouse Station''s listing is Mahj N More, a studio on US 22 East with open play, Intro to Mahjong lessons and guided play. The National Mah Jongg League card is sold as an add-on to its events. New players can start with the intro lesson, and seats are limited, so register ahead.' WHERE "slug" = 'whitehouse-station';
UPDATE "City" SET "published" = 1, "intro" = 'Salem, Arkansas has Rocky Pines Mahjong, which hosts open play and themed gatherings at Old Main Auditorium and runs The Scramble, a four-week American mahjong ladder league where players schedule their own matches. Check the club''s site for dates and any fees.' WHERE "slug" = 'salem';
UPDATE "City" SET "published" = 1, "intro" = 'North Texas Mahjong, based in the Little Elm area, runs an American Mahjong Foundations workshop for newcomers and open play at TinMan Social in Little Elm. Some sessions are held at Bella Mia Winery in Pilot Point, where registration is on the winery''s own site. Check each event page for the venue.' WHERE "slug" = 'little-elm';
UPDATE "City" SET "published" = 1, "intro" = 'Cumming''s listing is Evenings at the Table. Its Mahjong Foundations series teaches American Mahjong from the tiles and the NMJL card through the Charleston and exposures, in a beginner-friendly setting. Open play is held on Monday evenings at Talk of the Table.' WHERE "slug" = 'cumming';
UPDATE "City" SET "published" = 1, "intro" = 'Round Rock''s listing is Mahj the Rock, which runs open play for players who know American Mahjong, beginner guided play, and Mahjong 101 and 102 classes at cafes and breweries around Round Rock and nearby Cedar Park. Bring a 2026 National Mah Jongg League card; a few loaners are available.' WHERE "slug" = 'round-rock';
